    loss, damage or injury arising from the misuse of its products, from any use other than
    in-vitro laboratory research, or from any failure by the purchaser to comply with the
    obligations set out above.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nothing in this disclaimer excludes or limits our liability for death or personal injury caused
    by our negligence, for fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation, or for any other liability that
    cannot lawfully be excluded.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Right to refuse</h2>
  <p>
    We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order, at our sole discretion and without stating
    a reason, including where we have grounds to believe the products may be used other than as
    permitted above.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Questions</h2>
  <p>
    Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> if anything here is
